        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9d68d98a-13cf-5323-8a83-7346374bc70e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Non-Stop, Keep Watching, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, Scary Movie\n- People: Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy, Andrew Rona, Nicolas Chartier, Alex Heineman, Craig J. Flores, Michael Fiore, Joseph Dembner\n- Television Series: Downton Abbey\n- Awards: Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Downton Abbey ran from 2010 to 2015 on ITV in the UK and PBS in the U.S.\n- Michelle Dockery is most widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in Downton Abbey.\n- Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and a Golden Globe Award nomination for Downton Abbey.\n- Non-Stop is a 2014 American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop stars Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.\n- Andrew Rona has produced over 100 films, including Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, and Scary Movie.\n- Keep Watching was produced by Nicolas Chartier, Andrew Rona, Alex Heineman, Craig J. Flores, Michael Fiore, and Joseph Dembner.",
